. Please take note.EquipmentYour stamina is now displayed. Exhaustion will no longer come as a surprise.ControlsController operation has been reviewed and corrected. Dropdown menus now open on confirmation, the settings can be navigated in the order shown on screen, and Reset, Apply and Exit are reachable. Directional pad inputs are no longer swallow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:59:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037510-1846651706678521","game_id":"steam-5037510","kind":"update","title":"Trial Shift Notice: Demo Update Is Live","summary":"From: Facility Management Subject: Lighting System Malfunction Dear Inventory Care Specialist, several employees have reported that operations stall at the start of the rest period, as soon as the lighting is switched off section by section. The reports have been reviewed. The cause does not lie with you.Lighting SystemThe shutdown placed more strain on workstations with limited graphics memory than intended. The system has been adjusted accordingly.The lights will continue to switch off on sche","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:36:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678521","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037510-1846651706675324","game_id":"steam-5037510","kind":"update","title":"Trial Shift Notice: Demo Update Is Live","summary":"From: Facility ServicesSubject: Minor AdjustmentsDear Inventory Associate,The following minor adjustments have been made. No briefing is scheduled.Collection PitsPits now take on the colors of the balls you deposit.BuildingBalls pushed through the doors in the waiting area now reliably arrive on the other side.The surfaces in the classroom have been renewed.The hotel door in the playroom now keeps its intended appearance.WorkstationThe X button on the computer now closes programs properly.Breaks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T18:46:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675324","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037510-1846018067944954","game_id":"steam-5037510","kind":"update","title":"Trial Shift Notice: Demo Update Is Live","summary":"From: Facility Management Subject: Adjustments to Workplace and FacilitiesDear Inventory Maintenance Specialist,As part of ongoing maintenance, the following adjustments have been made. No briefing is scheduled.ControlsDoors, collection pits, dispensing points and equipment can now also be operated with the E key. The left mouse button remains valid.The tool icons in the bottom right now display their assigned key (1, 2, F). When using a controller, the numbers are omitted. The hand lamp continu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T17:57:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944954","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5037510-1846018067941915","game_id":"steam-5037510","kind":"announcement","title":"Trial Shift Now Available: The Demo Is Live","summary":"Trial Shift Now Available: The Demo Is LiveDear Inventory Maintenance Specialist,You can now begin your trial shift. You can complete it in the demo: Your task remains the same. Units must be stored in the designated collection basins. Equipment are available to you. The costs will be deducted from your compe